# One Klingon warship fires on a sensor station, which has no shields, on kling1; its beam shows the hull hit sprite at
# the station. Run it with --map kling1; the README, "Run a play script", has the command.
scroll up 15
hold Right 1.4
hold Down 1.6
wait 0.2
select Vorcha6
attack Sensor5
wait 0.15
shot hull-1
wait 0.15
shot hull-2
wait 0.15
shot hull-3
wait 0.15
shot hull-4
wait 0.15
shot hull-5
wait 0.15
shot hull-6
wait 0.15
shot hull-7
wait 0.15
shot hull-8
wait 0.15
shot hull-9
wait 0.15
shot hull-10
wait 0.15
shot hull-11
wait 0.15
shot hull-12
wait 0.15
shot hull-13
wait 0.15
shot hull-14
dump after
